codex
The units are already rendered as instanced billboards, so replacing them with `InstancedMesh` would not automatically improve performance. Collision checks still scan candidate arrays for each bullet, and the crowd follows fixed formation slots rather than navigating obstacles. I’m checking the effects and scenery code for additional costs and existing gameplay features.
