     1	"use strict";
     2	// Powerups: airdrops (cargo plane, parachute crate, a shootable supply crate holding a power-up), the four power-ups
     3	// (SHIELD, AIRSTRIKE, GIANT, JACKPOT) and explosive barrels. See design/engagement.md F5 / F6.
     4	// Everything simulates on the bus `tick` (game time, so slow-mo applies); billboards are oriented on `frame`.
